{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2日目の福岡でのおいシャンの\nラストの掛け声を\n題名にしてみました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもあの部分みんなで相談して\n決めてるんだよ〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/20/5447440/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長身2人に挟まれるみなみ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福岡公演終わり、\n真夏の全国ツアー地方公演が\n全て終了しました〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全力だった〜！\n無事に終われて良かった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして楽しかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暑い中わざわざ来てくださった皆さん、\n応援してくれた皆さん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のライブは、\n赤と青がテーマになっているコーナーがあって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サイリウムカラーが\n赤と青の私はとても楽しかった( ˙³˙)♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ある意味私信。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのコーナーをステージから見ていると\nやっぱり赤と青は綺麗！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"混ぜると紫だしね♪\n客席からも目立つしね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の地方公演ツアーも、\n素敵な思い出になりました(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のちは\"食\"散歩は〜？！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の福岡の打ち上げで、\nメンバー全員で行った"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"水炊きのお店「いろは」さん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/20/5447440/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お腹が空いて堪らない\n楽しみな表情のメンバー達♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/20/5447440/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"水炊きが本当美味しくて\nびっくりしました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山食べちゃった♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これが本物の水炊きか...と。\nお上品でした( ◦˙ ˙◦ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてお店全体にお店に来られた\n著名人の方々のサインが\n沢山飾られていました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"水炊きを食べて、\n確かにこれは愛されるだろうな...、\n何度も食べに来たくなるな...と、\n理由がわかりました :-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明太子も言わずもがな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"味もしっかりしててプリプリで\nお家でも食べたくなっちゃった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お家に明太子お土産買ってこうかな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと私が大好きなのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"如水庵さんのぶどう大福！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/20/5447440/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私果物が大好きで、\n葡萄が大好きなんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかもさらに、お餅が大好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということはこの組み合わせは\n最強としか言いようがない(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝にも食べました〜\n朝から贅沢〜おいしかった〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「桜花爛漫」KEYTALKさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌い出しの部分が好き！\n曲が始まるっていうドキドキ感と\nワクワク感を感じられる♪\nあとテンポが心地よい。\n聞いてると一緒に歌いたくなる！\n明大祭に来るらしい。、\n行きたい( ;o; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の夜は疲れちゃって\n知らぬ間に寝ちゃってました(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更新待っててくれた方\nちょっと遅くなってごめんね〜( ;o; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もがんばろうね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}